# Day 37 — High Availability (ALB + Target Groups)

## Objective
Implement high availability by distributing traffic across multiple EC2 instances using an Application Load Balancer.

---

## Architecture

User → ALB → Target Group → EC2 Instance A + EC2 Instance B

---

## Steps Completed

### 1. Launched Two EC2 Instances
- Same AMI (Amazon Linux)
- Same instance type
- Same security group (HTTP port 80 open)
- Same IAM role (SSM + CloudWatch)

Installed nginx on both:
```bash
sudo yum install nginx -y
sudo systemctl start nginx
sudo systemctl enable nginx